<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Macquarie's PUMA bonds priced at 21.3 bp over.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Macquarie's PUMA bonds priced at 21.3 bp over.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PUMA managament Ltd, Macquarie Bank's mortgage securitisation vehicle, said its A$500 million Series B bonds from its P-5 Master Fund were priced at 21.3 basis points over the 90-day bank bill swap rate (BBSW).</p>
</text>
